defmodule NativeMemory do
  # Memory that is given back (spec/alchem-memory.md). The collector is
  # machine code (gm_blob, native-memory-data.alc, from spec/memory-x86_64.s)
  # appended to a program's code; the last 88 bytes of the entry hold the
  # addresses allocation sites and the map code call through (gm_entry):
  #   0x400458 grow, 0x400460 start, 0x400468 Sys.call, 0x400470 reserve,
  #   0x400478 the allocation hook.
